  },
  {
    "text": "is most clear in retreat",
    "start": 2212.24,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "residential retreat. It's like the",
    "start": 2215.44,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "energy is high and whatever is happening",
    "start": 2217.599,
    "duration": 4.721
  },
  {
    "text": "okay and there's interest and",
    "start": 2219.68,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "investigation, motivation, aliveness and",
    "start": 2222.32,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "then the energy flags",
    "start": 2225.44,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "and you can feel you're more prone to",
    "start": 2228.32,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "dharma meltdowns.",
    "start": 2232.24,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "In the the research literature, those",
    "start": 2235.2,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "moments are known as more, you know,",
    "start": 2237.599,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "self-regulation failure.",
    "start": 2239.92,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "self-regulation failure.",
    "start": 2243.04,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2246.24,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "in the course of a retreat, when the",
    "start": 2248.72,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "energy flags,",
    "start": 2251.2,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "we move into a mode of purification.",
    "start": 2253.92,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And it's quite gruesome to watch the",
    "start": 2259.76,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness decay",
    "start": 2263.04,
    "duration": 6.079
  },
  {
    "text": "as we kind of tumble down",
    "start": 2265.52,
    "duration": 9.24
  },
  {
    "text": "the hill from peace into purification.",
    "start": 2269.119,
    "duration": 5.641
  },
  {
    "text": "But",
    "start": 2276.0,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "that's all part of practice",
    "start": 2278.88,
    "duration": 7.239
  },
  {
    "text": "and we do our best.",
    "start": 2282.24,
    "duration": 3.879
  },
  {
    "text": "And so sometimes we have to tolerate uh",
    "start": 2286.4,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "our",
    "start": 2292.0,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "tolerate these kind of low energy",
    "start": 2293.599,
    "duration": 8.961
  },
  {
    "text": "periods and sometimes we rally we rally",
    "start": 2298.56,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "our energy.",
    "start": 2302.56,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "So very briefly from the the Tibetan",
    "start": 2305.359,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "tradition for thoughts that turn the",
    "start": 2308.64,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "mind towards the the dharma.",
    "start": 2310.72,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "It's a way of rallying the energy to to",
    "start": 2316.24,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "to one",
    "start": 2319.04,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "um reflect and appreciate the",
    "start": 2321.68,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "preciousness of human life that we are",
    "start": 2324.72,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "thrown into the condition of living and",
    "start": 2327.04,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "it feels so evident that I should exist",
    "start": 2330.0,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "that everything that does exist should",
    "start": 2333.44,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "exist but it might have been otherwise",
    "start": 2335.359,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "in fact it's astounding",
    "start": 2340.48,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "that it was not otherwise.",
    "start": 2343.359,
    "duration": 3.601
  },
  {
    "text": "And this precious human life will not",
    "start": 2349.52,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "last.",
    "start": 2352.8,
    "duration": 4.559
  },
  {
    "text": "It It's very hard to believe that",
    "start": 2355.119,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "everything changes. Even our brain has",
    "start": 2357.359,
    "duration": 4.321
  },
  {
    "text": "trouble. I was just reading a study on",
    "start": 2359.68,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "like uh cortical reorganization after an",
    "start": 2361.68,
    "duration": 8.88
  },
  {
    "text": "amputation of an arm. There's like you",
    "start": 2367.04,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "know kind of phantom limb pain where my",
    "start": 2370.56,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "arm was",
    "start": 2373.28,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "the pain remains",
    "start": 2375.52,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and grief is like that a lot of",
    "start": 2378.64,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "you know the depth to which we assume a",
    "start": 2383.52,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "measure of permanence if it feels woven",
    "start": 2387.28,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "into our brain",
    "start": 2390.64,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "hard to believe everything changes and",
    "start": 2393.839,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "yet it does.",
    "start": 2396.24,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "And to get that in our bones,",
    "start": 2398.8,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "to to to, you know, to to bring that",
    "start": 2401.92,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "contemplation into our bones helps clear",
    "start": 2405.52,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "away",
    "start": 2409.28,
    "duration": 3.839
  },
  {
    "text": "what's meaningless.",
    "start": 2411.04,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And there's a lot that we do",
    "start": 2413.119,
    "duration": 8.641
  },
  {
    "text": "that offers zero consolation in the face",
    "start": 2417.76,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "of death.",
    "start": 2421.76,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "We want to contemplate if it's worth",
    "start": 2425.2,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "persisting in that.",
    "start": 2427.52,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "What would you",
    "start": 2432.88,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Yeah. What would",
    "start": 2438.48,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "what would um",
    "start": 2440.88,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "life have to be to feel complete?",
    "start": 2444.88,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Is that possible? Hope it's possible.",
    "start": 2448.079,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "But we in inquire what what kind what",
    "start": 2452.32,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "what would I have to do learn relax let",
    "start": 2455.119,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "go",
    "start": 2459.28,
    "duration": 4.079
  },
  {
    "text": "for life to feel complete? What would I",
    "start": 2460.96,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "have to discover? What would I have to",
    "start": 2463.359,
    "duration": 3.441
  },
  {
    "text": "love",
    "start": 2465.28,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "for this to have felt like a complete",
    "start": 2466.8,
    "duration": 6.2
  },
  {
    "text": "life",
    "start": 2470.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and karma karma that it's not to say",
    "start": 2475.2,
    "duration": 7.119
  },
  {
    "text": "that our life is entirely a function of",
    "start": 2479.44,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "our own action but there are trends",
    "start": 2482.319,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "and goodness tends towards goodness. If",
    "start": 2485.92,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "we marinate in hate, that has its own",
    "start": 2489.04,
    "duration": 5.48
  },
  {
    "text": "effects.",
    "start": 2491.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And the defects of of u",
    "start": 2496.64,
    "duration": 6.719
  },
  {
    "text": "samsara,",
    "start": 2501.359,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the fourth thought that turns the mind",
    "start": 2503.359,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "towards the dharma,",
    "start": 2505.359,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "the defects of samsara, the cyclical",
    "start": 2508.24,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "realm.",
    "start": 2511.76,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We can be respectful of the goodness on",
    "start": 2514.8,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "offer here.",
    "start": 2517.359,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "And there's a lot.",
    "start": 2519.44,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "But the enormous kind of",
    "start": 2522.48,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "sometimes think of it as like a the",
    "start": 2526.319,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "enormous pile of pleasure we've",
    "start": 2528.64,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "accumulated",
    "start": 2531.2,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "has been good and certainly better than",
    "start": 2533.52,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "pain, but it's not been enough to quench",
    "start": 2535.44,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "our heart.",
    "start": 2537.76,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "We contemplate this",
    "start": 2544.64,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Now just before we end, I want to",
    "start": 2550.4,
    "duration": 7.919
  },
  {
    "text": "acknowledge that much of what I've said",
    "start": 2554.88,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "is compatible with incredible uh",
    "start": 2558.319,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "striving. And somewhere very early in my",
    "start": 2561.359,
    "duration": 7.041
  },
  {
    "text": "practice, Vya and Sakya got yolked",
    "start": 2564.96,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "together.",
    "start": 2568.4,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "The effort, energy, and self view were",
    "start": 2570.24,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "yolked together.",
    "start": 2575.04,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And so the the question is like what",
    "start": 2578.079,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "would your effort look like freed",
    "start": 2581.68,
    "duration": 8.2
  },
  {
    "text": "from the logic of self",
    "start": 2584.96,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "for me uh the the energy becomes more",
    "start": 2592.64,
    "duration": 9.76
  },
  {
    "text": "about willingness than willfulness",
    "start": 2597.68,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "becomes more about there's energy in it",
    "start": 2602.4,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "For sure, sometimes a lot. The energy of",
    "start": 2606.16,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "surrender, the dissolution",
    "start": 2609.599,
    "duration": 7.681
  },
  {
    "text": "of volitional energies, exerting",
    "start": 2613.04,
    "duration": 10.76
  },
  {
    "text": "oneself, the will to power on the world.",
    "start": 2617.28,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "The sense of um effort being sourced",
    "start": 2624.8,
    "duration": 5.279
  },
  {
    "text": "from something",
    "start": 2627.76,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "uh less like self, more like love.",
    "start": 2630.079,
    "duration": 5.961
  },
  {
    "text": "So,",
    "start": 2637.359,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "I offer this for your uh consideration",
    "start": 2640.16,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh thank you for for having me. I uh",
    "start": 2644.16,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "have appreciated our time together",
    "start": 2648.48,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and um yeah, I wish you all well. Gil's",
    "start": 2652.24,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "on his way back uh soon in the Sierras,",
    "start": 2655.44,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Big Springs. Uh very lovely spot,",
    "start": 2659.44,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "retreat center. So um I wish you uh wish",
    "start": 2663.52,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "you all well and see you uh somewhere on",
    "start": 2667.44,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "the Dharma campus.",
    "start": 2669.68,
    "duration": 3.88
  }
]